{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act33side_level_act33side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act33side",
  "stageId": "act33side_04",
  "title": "Long Voyage",
  "storyCode": "BB-4",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1524f21b4676798626ad26c0aa953069331a9c302f75dd4e6bd1fc6022d4c015",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Autumn, 1091\nRhodes Island of Babel, Kazdel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How's progress, Closure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The last thing I need is another core system control failure."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well... Heh, since you had to bring it up, I might have run into a little problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even with the tricks you taught me, the encryption methods used by many of PRTS's programs are almost incomprehensible to a normal brain, and my decoder isn't fully compatible yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We may not be able to shut the system down before the Doctor arrives on the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Try again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you're not confident about getting it done, then we'll go to the contingency plan... cutting off power to the entire ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Leave it to me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Seems like you're still keeping a lot of secrets, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never seen anyone make you so nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...That's not important."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's important is making sure nothing happens to the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ascalon's report says the Doctor looks like an ordinary person. A pretty decent one, too, who picked up a stray little Cautus and carried her all across the land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do we really have to be so on edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not the Doctor that I fear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then what is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You don't need to know yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wipe the Doctor's boarding records. This is for the safety of both the Doctor and Babel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The others don't need to know that the Doctor exists until the Doctor and Theresa have reached a conclusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright, alright, I'll work at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I wonder why you seem to care a lot about this Doctor at that same time that you're so on guard over the whole thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've got it! The Doctor must have dirt on you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't bother, you won't find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come on, why so serious?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about the girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Same conclusion, no change."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I cross-checked all relevant Rim Billitonian records and had Scout check with informants inside the Military Commission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya's background comes through clean."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her parents were killed when the convoy transporting the laser mining module got attacked. The attack itself was purely coincidental."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No one knew they were transporting Sarkaz-related cargo, and the Military Commission wasn't involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She must have gotten Infected in the mess. If not for the Doctor, she'd be spending the rest of her life suffering in Rim Billiton."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll handle the girl's examination and treatment once she's on board."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're still concerned about her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's too young, and she hasn't had proper treatment since contracting Oripathy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, that kind of concerned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't want the Doctor's kindness to be the reason for delaying her treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Plus, Theresa would call her a gentle child who has the right to choose her future."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya. Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Mm... let me sleep... where are we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doctor... Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Doctor's here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wake up, sleepyhead. You're almost home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In her half-awake state, Amiya feels a warm fingertip brush her cheek."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Haha, that tickles, don't do that, hehe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh-Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm Theresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theresa... the Doctor talked about you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh? What did the Doctor say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't remember... I was having a great carrot cake at the time, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Theresa should smell nice... be really warm and sweet..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What about now? Is she as you imagined her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah... smells good... warm and sweet... doesn't smell like carrots, though..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not fully awake, I see. Heh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Will you come home with us, Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Home... yeah... okay..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Outside Rhodes Island of Babel, Kazdel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The tiny Cautus sleeps soundly in Theresa's arms, leading against her neck.\nShe pats Amiya on the back and turns toward the Doctor, who is clearly tired."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you, Theresa. I didn't expect you to come pick us up personally."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Looks like you're not quite all-knowing, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have much to learn when it comes to childcare, at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You look different from when you left, Doctor. How was the journey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I saw a lot and learned a lot. There are plenty of interesting things on this great land."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I also met Amiya... it was a miracle that I was able to save her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya. She's even cuter than your letters said. Poor girl, but fortunate, in some way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her condition is getting worse. I needed to bring her in for treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How has Babel been, in the time that I was away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not quite smooth sailing. We have a lot to deal with, but not everything needs to be handled right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You must be tired after your journey. Get some rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you, Theresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya, we're home."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm... Doctor? Did I fall asleep?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, Amiya. You're awake."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why don't you come down? Theresa will get tired if she has to keep holding you."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Amiya nods and jumps down from Theresa's arms."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Will you hold my hand, Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doctor...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's alright. Theresa is my friend. You can trust her. You'll be spending a lot of time with her from now on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Okay..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this Babel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's so big... even bigger than those mining plates. So this is where you used to live."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I spent a long time here... a very long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is this your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, Amiya, this is the Doctor's home. Right, Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's your home now, too. Will you let us help the Doctor take care of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alright... I'll go wherever the Doctor goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They step onto the elevator, and the Babel logo appears before their eyes.\nThe heavy door opens to welcome them in.\nSensing Amiya's unease, Theresa puts a hand on her shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's behind the door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "People waiting to welcome you and the Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you sure about taking me and the girl in, Theresa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why shouldn't I be? I'm glad to have more people calling Babel their home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Many here don't know you, though, so I'm sure you'll be busy for the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How should I present myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Good question. You should talk to Kal'tsit first. She's been waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
