    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If you've made up your mind, I'll respect your decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If nothing else, you're concerned about Amiya's health... even though she was a complete stranger to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There is no fundamental difference between these new lives and us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'm glad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Glad that you chose hope, in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Welcome back, Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How is Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Blood Originium levels are high. Currently available inhibitors are not sufficient to stabilize her condition."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We need to develop new drugs... I need time and resources."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Babel's are yours to use, Doctor. We're happy to share our research on Oripathy with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What can I help you and Kal'tsit with in exchange?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This is not a transaction. It's one of the core missions of Babel, to do everything in our power to help everyone suffering from Oripathy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Since the day that Kal'tsit woke you up, I was convinced that you would help with all of this, just as you helped Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now, perhaps, I have a chance to ask you this question, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How do you view this land, Terra?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't think it's my place to judge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's no such thing as superior or inferior civilizations. It took a long and hard journey for Terra to evolve to where it is today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Add to that the sick joke that Originium has played on life..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You said that Originium did not develop the way you expected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It wasn't supposed to bring such suffering."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Mumbles in her dream)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I sense that you are keeping secrets, but there's nothing false about the sorrow coming from deep within your heart, the sorrow that I can't understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to fix this mistake, but I'm powerless to do so..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At the end of the day, civilizations largely progress in similar ways. It all comes to an inevitable endpoint, however bright its light shines at its peak."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Kal'tsit said you didn't give up hope, even in your final days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I had many friends, even in those last days, who faced difficulties far greater than you can imagine, with courage and hope that is every bit your equal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But they failed and faded away, without exception."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We haven't known each other that long, Theresa. I want to know: Why do you do all this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is the end that Babel seeks in compromising with the Military Commission?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's something I want to show you, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We had to ask you about Originium, sooner or later. That's why Kal'tsit woke you up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please, come and see the results of my... brief time at work."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're almost there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place is barren, even by the standards of a Catastrophe-heavy region. But Closure has spent time and effort to maintain this dangerous little trail..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A forked trail in the midst of Originium formations. You're not keeping any fewer secrets than I am, Theresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A King of Sarkaz has to have a few secrets, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't tell anyone what you see here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A long trek through the Originium-filled wasteland leads to a small garden.\nIn the heart of a Catastrophe, amidst the ruins, on a nameless plain that neither night nor the stars can find.\nTiny white specks mark this little sanctuary, isolated from the rest of the world, and the wild lands around it. Even the winds seem softer here.\nIt is a forgotten greenhouse that harkens back to a time in the distant past, when the land was still pure and untainted.\nLike when man stole fire from up above and lit up a corner of the night sky.\nTheresa picks up a white flower."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place represents the cutting edge of Babel's and my research into Originium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Flowers...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. Originium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm sure you understand it's not Originium Arts that made these flowers bloom."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The information inherent in Originium, the reversal of the Assimilated Universe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've already come this far? When did...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No race understands Originium better than the Sarkaz. Still, what we know is merely the tip of the iceberg compared to the entirety of Originium."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even with Kal'tsit helping us understand the nature of Originium, the furthest we have gone is transforming a palm-sized piece of active Originium into this..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Garden."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This little flower is my small contribution. I need your help, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to see the day when flowers cover the cliffs and valleys of Kazdel, and all the lands beyond."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's a future worth taking risks for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've seen how Kazdel has been mired in war for its entire history, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Right now, at least, I want to use the power of Originium to create a home for Kazdel where people can live in peace, safe from war and invasion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "In the more distant future... if we're able to fully harness it, we'll be able to change the entire face of Terra."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If Catastrophes don't bring rain of Originium, but soft fluffy clouds..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If the Infected no longer suffer the pain of rocks growing out of them..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't suppose there's anyone who would have such an absurd dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're different from other Sarkaz, Theresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Flowers that cover the entire land..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a picture of life that would be."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why... why this flower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh... there's no particular reason. I just happened to come across it outside the valley when I was looking for a good place for my experiments."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A pure coincidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kal'tsit said it had a name. 'Snow-in-summer'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But it's adapted to changes over the years. Perhaps we could give it a new name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do you think, Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Doctor",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you hear me, Theresa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerToken": null,
